Short:        Cpio xadmaster client (part of RPM)
Author:       polluks@sdf.lonestar.org (Stefan Haubenthal)
Uploader:     polluks sdf lonestar org (Stefan Haubenthal)
Type:         dev/src
Version:      1.3
Requires:     util/arc/xadmaster.lha
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

--- About this archive ---

This archive contains the cpio client for Dirk Stöcker's XAD system -
util/arc/xadmaster.lha and also includes the source code to this client.

--- About the client ---

To install the client, unpack this archive, then execute this command

 smake install

This client lets XAD view and extract cpio archives. Cpio is a
program like tar - it collects files into nothing but an archive.

To unpack an RPM package execute following commands

 cd dir-of-foo
 rx redhat foo.rpm
